    <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-midnight-navy-1 to-atlantic-teal-2 rounded-[20px] md:rounded-[40px] mt-12 p-5">
                    <p class="text-kicker text-atlantic-teal-3">Live webcast — Agentic AI: Because finding bugs manually is so 2025</p>
                            <p class="text-base text-white mt-2">Join us on November 18 for the next episode of runZero Hour with Tod Beardsley, Bri Cluck, HD Moore, and Calif.io Chief Thai Duong to discuss the new realities of bug hunting and vulnerability disclosure in the age of AI.</p>
                            <div class="flex mt-5">
