                            <p class="text-base text-white mt-2">Evaluating security solutions tailored for industrial settings, this report highlights purpose-built capabilities that can be safely deployed in fragile OT environments without disrupting operations. Within this landscape, runZero is recognized as a Challenger and Fast Mover in the Innovation/Platform Play quadrant.</p>
